      },
      "description": "The usage series works; the dashed limit/request reference lines stay absent until the Deployment declares resources. REQUIRES RESOURCE LIMITS. Verified 2026-08-11: the api-gateway-backend-dev container declares `resources: {}` - no requests, no limits. kube_pod_container_resource_limits therefore emits nothing, and with no CPU quota the kernel never populates the CFS throttling counters. Set requests/limits on the Deployment and this panel fills in by itself."
    },
