    {
      "id": 1000,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "NODE HEALTH",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 197,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "collapsed": true,
      "panels": [
        {
          "id": 1001,
          "title": "Node CPU utilisation",
          "type": "timeseries",
          "gridPos": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 196,
            "w": 8,
            "h": 7
          },
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${prometheus_datasource}"
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "refId": "A",
              "editorMode": "code",
              "expr": "100 * (1 - avg by (instance) (rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{mode=\"idle\",instance=~\"$node\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
              "range": true,
              "instant": false,
              "legendFormat": "{{instance}}",
              "interval": "2m"
            }
          ],
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "unit": "percent",
              "decimals": 1,
              "min": 0,
              "max": 100,
              "custom": {
                "spanNulls": true,
                "insertNulls": false
              }
            },
            "overrides": []
          },
          "options": {
            "legend": {
              "displayMode": "list",
              "placement": "bottom"
            },
            "tooltip": {
              "mode": "multi",
              "sort": "desc"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 1002,
          "title": "Node memory utilisation",
          "type": "timeseries",
          "gridPos": {
            "x": 8,
            "y": 196,
            "w": 8,
            "h": 7
          },
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${prometheus_datasource}"
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "refId": "A",
              "editorMode": "code",
              "expr": "100 * (1 - (node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes{instance=~\"$node\"} / node_memory_MemTotal_bytes{instance=~\"$node\"}))",
              "range": true,
              "instant": false,
              "legendFormat": "{{instance}}"
            }
          ],
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "unit": "percent",
              "decimals": 1,
              "min": 0,
              "max": 100,
              "custom": {
                "spanNulls": true,
                "insertNulls": false
              }
            },
            "overrides": []
          },
          "options": {
            "legend": {
              "displayMode": "list",
              "placement": "bottom"
            },
            "tooltip": {
              "mode": "multi",
              "sort": "desc"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 1003,
          "title": "Node load (1m / 5m / 15m per core)",
          "type": "timeseries",
          "gridPos": {
            "x": 16,
            "y": 196,
            "w": 8,
            "h": 7
          },
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${prometheus_datasource}"
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "refId": "A",
              "editorMode": "code",
              "expr": "node_load1{instance=~\"$node\"} / on(instance) group_left count by (instance) (node_cpu_seconds_total{mode=\"idle\",instance=~\"$node\"})",
              "range": true,
              "instant": false,
              "legendFormat": "load1/core {{instance}}"
            },
            {
              "refId": "B",
              "editorMode": "code",
              "expr": "node_load15{instance=~\"$node\"} / on(instance) group_left count by (instance) (node_cpu_seconds_total{mode=\"idle\",instance=~\"$node\"})",
              "range": true,
              "instant": false,
              "legendFormat": "load15/core {{instance}}"
            }
          ],
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "unit": "short",
              "decimals": 2,
              "custom": {
                "spanNulls": true,
                "insertNulls": false
              }
            },
            "overrides": []
          },
          "options": {
            "legend": {
              "displayMode": "list",
              "placement": "bottom"
            },
            "tooltip": {
              "mode": "multi",
              "sort": "desc"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 1004,
          "title": "Node filesystem utilisation",
          "type": "timeseries",
          "gridPos": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 203,
            "w": 8,
            "h": 7
          },
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${prometheus_datasource}"
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "refId": "A",
              "editorMode": "code",
              "expr": "100 * (1 - (node_filesystem_avail_bytes{instance=~\"$node\",fstype!~\"tmpfs|overlay|squashfs\",mountpoint!~\"/run.*|/var/lib/kubelet.*\"} / node_filesystem_size_bytes{instance=~\"$node\",fstype!~\"tmpfs|overlay|squashfs\",mountpoint!~\"/run.*|/var/lib/kubelet.*\"}))",
              "range": true,
              "instant": false,
              "legendFormat": "{{instance}} {{mountpoint}}"
            }
          ],
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "unit": "percent",
              "decimals": 1,
              "min": 0,
              "max": 100,
              "custom": {
                "thresholdsStyle": {
                  "mode": "dashed"
                },
                "spanNulls": true,
                "insertNulls": false
              },
              "thresholds": {
                "mode": "absolute",
                "steps": [
                  {
                    "color": "green",
                    "value": null
                  },
                  {
                    "color": "yellow",
                    "value": 80
                  },
                  {
                    "color": "red",
                    "value": 90
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            "overrides": []
          },
          "options": {
            "legend": {
              "displayMode": "list",
              "placement": "bottom"
            },
            "tooltip": {
              "mode": "multi",
              "sort": "desc"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 1005,
          "title": "Node disk I/O",
          "type": "timeseries",
          "gridPos": {
            "x": 8,
            "y": 203,
            "w": 8,
            "h": 7
          },
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${prometheus_datasource}"
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "refId": "A",
              "editorMode": "code",
              "expr": "sum by (instance) (rate(node_disk_read_bytes_total{instance=~\"$node\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
              "range": true,
              "instant": false,
              "legendFormat": "read {{instance}}",
              "interval": "2m"
            },
            {
              "refId": "B",
              "editorMode": "code",
              "expr": "-sum by (instance) (rate(node_disk_written_bytes_total{instance=~\"$node\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
              "range": true,
              "instant": false,
              "legendFormat": "write {{instance}}",
              "interval": "2m"
            }
          ],
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "unit": "Bps",
              "decimals": 2,
              "custom": {
                "spanNulls": true,
                "insertNulls": false
              }
            },
            "overrides": []
          },
          "options": {
            "legend": {
              "displayMode": "list",
              "placement": "bottom"
            },
            "tooltip": {
              "mode": "multi",
              "sort": "desc"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 1006,
          "title": "Node network RX / TX",
          "type": "timeseries",
          "gridPos": {
            "x": 16,
            "y": 203,
            "w": 8,
            "h": 7
          },
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${prometheus_datasource}"
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "refId": "A",
              "editorMode": "code",
              "expr": "sum by (instance) (rate(node_network_receive_bytes_total{instance=~\"$node\",device!~\"lo|veth.*|cali.*|tunl.*|flannel.*|cni.*\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
              "range": true,
              "instant": false,
              "legendFormat": "RX {{instance}}",
              "interval": "2m"
            },
            {
              "refId": "B",
              "editorMode": "code",
              "expr": "-sum by (instance) (rate(node_network_transmit_bytes_total{instance=~\"$node\",device!~\"lo|veth.*|cali.*|tunl.*|flannel.*|cni.*\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
              "range": true,
              "instant": false,
              "legendFormat": "TX {{instance}}",
              "interval": "2m"
            }
          ],
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "unit": "Bps",
              "decimals": 2,
              "custom": {
                "spanNulls": true,
                "insertNulls": false
              }
            },
            "overrides": []
          },
          "options": {
            "legend": {
              "displayMode": "list",
              "placement": "bottom"
            },
            "tooltip": {
              "mode": "multi",
              "sort": "desc"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 1007,
          "title": "Pod density (running / allocatable)",
          "type": "timeseries",
          "gridPos": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 210,
            "w": 12,
            "h": 7
          },
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${prometheus_datasource}"
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "refId": "A",
              "editorMode": "code",
              "expr": "count by (node) (kube_pod_info{node=~\"$node\"})",
              "range": true,
              "instant": false,
              "legendFormat": "pods {{node}}"
            },
            {
              "refId": "B",
              "editorMode": "code",
              "expr": "sum by (node) (kube_node_status_allocatable{resource=\"pods\",node=~\"$node\"})",
              "range": true,
              "instant": false,
              "legendFormat": "allocatable {{node}}"
            }
          ],
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "unit": "short",
              "decimals": 0,
              "custom": {
                "spanNulls": true,
                "insertNulls": false
              }
            },
            "overrides": []
          },
          "options": {
            "legend": {
              "displayMode": "list",
              "placement": "bottom"
            },
            "tooltip": {
              "mode": "multi",
              "sort": "desc"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 1008,
          "title": "Node conditions",
          "type": "timeseries",
          "gridPos": {
            "x": 12,
            "y": 210,
            "w": 12,
            "h": 7
          },
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${prometheus_datasource}"
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "refId": "A",
              "editorMode": "code",
              "expr": "sum by (node, condition) (kube_node_status_condition{condition!=\"Ready\",status=\"true\"} > 0) or vector(0)",
              "range": true,
              "instant": false,
              "legendFormat": "{{node}} {{condition}}"
            },
            {
              "refId": "B",
              "editorMode": "code",
              "expr": "sum by (node) (kube_node_status_condition{condition=\"Ready\",status=\"true\"})",
              "range": true,
              "instant": false,
              "legendFormat": "{{node}} Ready"
            }
          ],
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "unit": "short",
              "decimals": 0,
              "custom": {
                "spanNulls": true,
                "insertNulls": false
              }
            },
            "overrides": []
          },
          "options": {
            "legend": {
              "displayMode": "list",
              "placement": "bottom"
            },
            "tooltip": {
              "mode": "multi",
              "sort": "desc"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1100,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "TELEMETRY PIPELINE HEALTH — check here first when panels say 'No data'",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 198,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "collapsed": true,
      "panels": [
        {
          "id": 1101,
          "title": "Collector — metric points sent vs FAILED, by exporter",
          "description": "Non-zero 'failed' on otlphttp/prometheus is the definitive proof that application metrics are not reaching Prometheus. The most common cause on this stack is out-of-order sample rejection by the Prometheus OTLP write receiver.",
          "type": "timeseries",
          "gridPos": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 197,
            "w": 12,
            "h": 8
          },
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${prometheus_datasource}"
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "refId": "A",
              "editorMode": "code",
              "expr": "sum by (exporter) (rate(otelcol_exporter_sent_metric_points_total[$__rate_interval]))",
              "range": true,
              "instant": false,
              "legendFormat": "sent {{exporter}}",
              "interval": "2m"
            },
            {
              "refId": "B",
              "editorMode": "code",
              "expr": "sum by (exporter) (rate(otelcol_exporter_send_failed_metric_points_total[$__rate_interval]))",
              "range": true,
              "instant": false,
              "legendFormat": "FAILED {{exporter}}",
              "interval": "2m"
            },
            {
              "refId": "C",
              "editorMode": "code",
              "expr": "sum by (receiver) (rate(otelcol_receiver_refused_metric_points_total[$__rate_interval]))",
              "range": true,
              "instant": false,
              "legendFormat": "refused {{receiver}}",
              "interval": "2m"
            }
          ],
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "unit": "ops",
              "decimals": 2,
              "custom": {
                "lineWidth": 2,
                "fillOpacity": 10,
                "spanNulls": true,
                "insertNulls": false
              }
            },
            "overrides": [
              {
                "matcher": {
                  "id": "byRegexp",
                  "options": "(FAILED|refused).*"
                },
                "properties": [
                  {
                    "id": "color",
                    "value": {
                      "mode": "fixed",
                      "fixedColor": "red"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "options": {
            "legend": {
              "displayMode": "table",
              "placement": "right",
              "calcs": [
                "lastNotNull",
                "max"
              ]
            },
            "tooltip": {
              "mode": "multi",
              "sort": "desc"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 1102,
          "title": "Prometheus OTLP write endpoint — responses by code",
          "description": "handler=\"/api/v1/otlp/v1/metrics\". Any code other than 200/204 means Prometheus is rejecting the collector's metric writes.",
          "type": "timeseries",
          "gridPos": {
            "x": 12,
            "y": 197,
            "w": 12,
            "h": 8
          },
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${prometheus_datasource}"
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "refId": "A",
              "editorMode": "code",
              "expr": "sum by (code) (rate(prometheus_http_requests_total{handler=~\"/api/v1/otlp.*\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
              "range": true,
              "instant": false,
              "legendFormat": "OTLP {{code}}",
              "interval": "2m"
            },
            {
              "refId": "B",
              "editorMode": "code",
              "expr": "sum by (code) (rate(prometheus_http_requests_total{handler=\"/api/v1/write\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
              "range": true,
              "instant": false,
              "legendFormat": "remote-write (Tempo generator) {{code}}",
              "interval": "2m"
            }
          ],
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "unit": "reqps",
              "decimals": 3,
              "custom": {
                "lineWidth": 2,
                "fillOpacity": 10,
                "spanNulls": true,
                "insertNulls": false
              }
            },
            "overrides": [
              {
                "matcher": {
                  "id": "byRegexp",
                  "options": ".*(4\\d\\d|5\\d\\d).*"
                },
                "properties": [
                  {
                    "id": "color",
                    "value": {
                      "mode": "fixed",
                      "fixedColor": "red"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "options": {
            "legend": {
              "displayMode": "table",
              "placement": "right",
              "calcs": [
                "lastNotNull",
                "max"
              ]
            },
            "tooltip": {
              "mode": "multi",
              "sort": "desc"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 1103,
          "title": "Collector — spans & logs sent vs FAILED",
          "type": "timeseries",
          "gridPos": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 205,
            "w": 12,
            "h": 7
          },
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${prometheus_datasource}"
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "refId": "A",
              "editorMode": "code",
              "expr": "sum by (exporter) (rate(otelcol_exporter_sent_spans_total[$__rate_interval]))",
              "range": true,
              "instant": false,
              "legendFormat": "spans sent {{exporter}}",
              "interval": "2m"
            },
            {
              "refId": "B",
              "editorMode": "code",
              "expr": "sum by (exporter) (rate(otelcol_exporter_send_failed_spans_total[$__rate_interval]))",
              "range": true,
              "instant": false,
              "legendFormat": "spans FAILED {{exporter}}",
              "interval": "2m"
            },
            {
              "refId": "C",
              "editorMode": "code",
              "expr": "sum by (exporter) (rate(otelcol_exporter_sent_log_records_total[$__rate_interval]))",
              "range": true,
              "instant": false,
              "legendFormat": "logs sent {{exporter}}",
              "interval": "2m"
            },
            {
              "refId": "D",
              "editorMode": "code",
              "expr": "sum by (exporter) (rate(otelcol_exporter_send_failed_log_records_total[$__rate_interval]))",
              "range": true,
              "instant": false,
              "legendFormat": "logs FAILED {{exporter}}",
              "interval": "2m"
            }
          ],
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "unit": "ops",
              "decimals": 2,
              "custom": {
                "spanNulls": true,
                "insertNulls": false
              }
            },
            "overrides": [
              {
                "matcher": {
                  "id": "byRegexp",
                  "options": ".*FAILED.*"
                },
                "properties": [
                  {
                    "id": "color",
                    "value": {
                      "mode": "fixed",
                      "fixedColor": "red"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "options": {
            "legend": {
              "displayMode": "table",
              "placement": "right",
              "calcs": [
                "lastNotNull",
                "max"
              ]
            },
            "tooltip": {
              "mode": "multi",
              "sort": "desc"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 1104,
          "title": "Collector — export queue & memory-limiter drops",
          "type": "timeseries",
          "gridPos": {
            "x": 12,
            "y": 205,
            "w": 12,
            "h": 7
          },
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${prometheus_datasource}"
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "refId": "A",
              "editorMode": "code",
              "expr": "sum by (exporter) (otelcol_exporter_queue_size)",
              "range": true,
              "instant": false,
              "legendFormat": "queue size {{exporter}}"
            },
            {
              "refId": "B",
              "editorMode": "code",
              "expr": "sum by (exporter) (otelcol_exporter_queue_capacity)",
              "range": true,
              "instant": false,
              "legendFormat": "queue capacity {{exporter}}"
            },
            {
              "refId": "C",
              "editorMode": "code",
              "expr": "sum by (processor) (rate(otelcol_processor_refused_metric_points_total[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)",
              "range": true,
              "instant": false,
              "legendFormat": "processor refused {{processor}}",
              "interval": "2m"
            }
          ],
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "unit": "short",
              "decimals": 2,
              "custom": {
                "spanNulls": true,
                "insertNulls": false
              }
            },
            "overrides": []
          },
          "options": {
            "legend": {
              "displayMode": "table",
              "placement": "right",
              "calcs": [
                "lastNotNull",
                "max"
              ]
            },
            "tooltip": {
              "mode": "multi",
              "sort": "desc"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 1105,
          "title": "SANITY CHECK — what identity labels actually exist on the HTTP metric (ignores all dashboard filters)",
          "description": "Deliberately unfiltered. If this table has rows but the panels above say 'No data', a dashboard VARIABLE is empty or wrong — compare the values here against the filter bar. If this table is empty too, the metric itself is not in Prometheus and the problem is the ingest pipeline, not the dashboard. 'Sample age' is seconds since that series was last written.",
          "type": "table",
          "gridPos": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 212,
            "w": 24,
            "h": 8
          },
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${prometheus_datasource}"
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "refId": "A",
              "editorMode": "code",
              "expr": "count by (service_name, k8s_namespace_name, deployment_environment, job) (http_server_request_duration_seconds_count)",
              "range": false,
              "instant": true,
              "format": "table"
            },
            {
              "refId": "B",
              "editorMode": "code",
              "expr": "time() - max by (service_name, k8s_namespace_name, deployment_environment, job) (max_over_time(timestamp(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count)[$__range:1m]))",
              "range": false,
              "instant": true,
              "format": "table"
            }
          ],
          "transformations": [
            {
              "id": "joinByField",
              "options": {
                "byField": "service_name",
                "mode": "outer"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "organize",
              "options": {
                "excludeByName": {
                  "Time": true,
                  "Time 1": true,
                  "Time 2": true,
                  "k8s_namespace_name 2": true,
                  "deployment_environment 2": true,
                  "job 2": true
                },
                "renameByName": {
                  "service_name": "service_name",
                  "k8s_namespace_name 1": "k8s_namespace_name",
                  "deployment_environment 1": "deployment_environment",
                  "job 1": "job",
                  "Value #A": "Series",
                  "Value #B": "Sample age"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "decimals": 0,
              "custom": {
                "align": "auto",
                "filterable": true
              }
            },
            "overrides": [
              {
                "matcher": {
                  "id": "byName",
                  "options": "Sample age"
                },
                "properties": [
                  {
                    "id": "unit",
                    "value": "s"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                    "value": {
                      "type": "color-background",
                      "mode": "gradient"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "thresholds",
                    "value": {
                      "mode": "absolute",
                      "steps": [
                        {
                          "color": "green",
                          "value": null
                        },
                        {
                          "color": "yellow",
                          "value": 180
                        },
                        {
                          "color": "red",
                          "value": 600
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "options": {
            "cellHeight": "sm",
            "showHeader": true
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1200,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to use this dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 199,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      },
      "transparent": true,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### The investigation path\n\n| Step | Panel | Datasource | Question it answers |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Golden Signals | Prometheus / PromQL | Is the service healthy at all? |\n| 2 | API Endpoint Performance | Prometheus / PromQL | Which endpoint is slow or failing? |\n| 3 | *click the row* | — | Sets `API Route` + `Method`, filtering everything below |\n| 4 | Selected endpoint panels | Prometheus / PromQL | Is it all requests or a tail? Is the latency bi-modal? |\n| 5 | API Requests | Tempo / TraceQL | Which individual requests were slow? |\n| 6 | *click the row* | — | Sets `Selected Trace ID` |\n| 7 | Selected trace waterfall | Tempo / TraceQL | Exactly where did the 89 ms go — controller, repository, Hikari `getConnection`, the SELECT, or a downstream call? |\n| 8 | Logs for the selected trace | Loki / LogQL | What did the app actually log for that request? |\n| 9 | JDBC pool / JVM / Pod / Node rows | Prometheus / PromQL | Was the cause the pool, the heap, throttling, or the node? |\n\n### Grafana limitation, stated plainly\nA Grafana table **cannot** expand a trace waterfall inside its own panel. The supported pattern — and the one used here — is: table row → data link → dashboard URL carrying `var-traceID` → a separate `traces` panel that queries Tempo by that ID. The redraw happens in this same browser tab, so it still behaves like a single window, but it is a variable round-trip, not an in-place expansion.\n\n### Scope notes\n* The **service dependency map** comes from Tempo's metrics-generator (`traces_service_graph_*`) and has no endpoint dimension by design. Use the waterfall for endpoint-level and request-level work.\n* **Per-statement SQL latency is not in Prometheus.** The OTel Java agent emits HikariCP pool metrics only. Statement timing comes from the Tempo JDBC/SQL spans panel.\n* **Peak threads** is a Micrometer metric, not an OTel one. The JVM threads panel shows `max_over_time()` across the selected range instead."
      }
    }
  ]
}